# Store as var/server.env (git-ignored, under /var/) with mode 0600; never commit
# values. Only `deploy/scripts/server-migrate.sh` (`make server-migrate`) reads it,
# and only for PUBLIC_HOST. The VM itself is installed from inside with
# `install-vm.sh` (ADR-017), whose options replace everything else.

# The domain the deployment answers to (the same one before and after the move).
PUBLIC_HOST=

# Not read by server-migrate.sh. PLATFORM_PRIVACY_URL (optional, https://..., the platform's
# privacy policy that the demo bot's first-contact notice links to) belongs in the server's
# /srv/autobot/.env: pass it to `install-vm.sh --env-file` (it is one of its known keys) or
# add it there by hand; compose.prod.yaml hands it to web and the workers.
# PLATFORM_PRIVACY_URL=
